==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{enPR|krō'kā}}, {{IPA|/ˈkrəʊkeɪ/}} or {{IPA|/ˈkrəʊkɪ/}}, {{X-SAMPA|/"kr@UkeI/}}
* {{a|US}} {{enPR|krōkā'}}, {{IPA|/kroʊˈkeɪ/}}, {{X-SAMPA|/kroU"keI/}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|s|-}}

# {{uncountable|games}} A [[game]] played on a [[lawn]], in which players use [[mallet]]s to drive [[wooden]] [[ball]]s through [[hoop]]s ([[wicket]]s).
# {{countable|games}} A [[shot]] in this game in which the [[opponent]]'s ball is driven away by hitting one's own ball when they are in contact.
# {{countable}} A [[croquette]].

====Derived terms====
* '''croquet''' [[set]]

